"そんな顔しなくても、今日が先生の誕生日ってことくらい知ってます 仕方ありませんね、祝ってあげますよ お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/jI56kvW6gq89gqcEPxZVWofbKHe7J3zh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0156_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"はい？とっとと飴ください。え？ちゃんと言って欲しい？ はいはい、トリックオアトリート","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/dbfh4JYxBAVk5jqhyZRT6qtMBbsCW20z.ogg"},{"description":"CH0156_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"あけましておめでとうございます、そうですね、願うことがあるとすれば 私は面倒ごとができるだけ少ないと良いですね","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/rMvt2ydODb9HRZIixwlYFhSIms65LRRd.ogg"},{"description":"CH0156_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"誰も彼も浮かれてますね... いいえ、別に嫌という訳では、外に出るのもあれですし 仕方ないので、先生と一緒に居てあげますか","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/BDoHpKnRsTkySF3QmGUsdG0Klwqm4JDA.ogg"},{"description":"SM015601_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"主砲発射。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/SM015601_CommonSkill.ogg"},{"description":"SM015601_InteractionCommonTSASkill","category":"battle","text":"（イブキ）やーっ！   （イロハ）虎丸、発射。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/SM015601_InteractionCommonTSASkill.ogg"},{"description":"SM015601_InteractionTSA_1","category":"battle","text":"（イブキ）あっ！イロハ先輩、あっち！     （イロハ）行きましょう、イブキ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/SM015601_InteractionTSA_1.ogg"},{"description":"SM015601_InteractionTSA_2","category":"battle","text":"（イブキ）悪い人、見ーっけ！     （イロハ）はい、対処します。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/SM015601_InteractionTSA_2.ogg"},{"description":"SM015601_InteractionTSA_3","category":"battle","text":"（イブキ）ねぇねぇ先輩、あそこ～！     （イロハ）万魔殿の出番ですね……面倒くさい。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/SM015601_InteractionTSA_3.ogg"},{"description":"SM015601_InteractionTSA_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"（イブキ）狙って～？     （イロハ）発射。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/SM015601_InteractionTSA_Level_1.ogg"},{"description":"SM015601_InteractionTSA_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"（イブキ）逃がさないよー！     （イロハ）狙います。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/SM015601_InteractionTSA_Level_2.ogg"},{"description":"SM015601_InteractionTSA_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"（イブキ）ばんば～ん！     （イロハ）外しません。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/SM015601_InteractionTSA_Level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"ん……留守番、してもいいんですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/original/jp/ch0156_formation_select.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0156_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"有没有，不容易被人发现的场所呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/JZKUAscxywd1CCn5k2oBezAOiAJDS6e7.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"果然，待在这里应该不会被发现吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/F6OXUtk333ZxWtd2ReEFB7x71utqFXT4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"攻击。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/QmfpqajH8fZj3iioFJNdtznMyxW2ydRR.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"交流会，感觉被搞砸了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/NEMRl9pOTvhmIgvh1O5mrgfD7ZH80hHB.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"唉……偶尔也要体谅一下处理烂摊子的人吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/0cOq16SWbDamkakXsuLOM1HRCYJieHMH.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"为什么要跑到别人的自管区做这些事……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/Rh0rtGqDdEKzKTWO3gv87RChihNrufoS.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"这就是，中层管理人员的痛苦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/Q7QLaaXq5y4bsl0KjLOZc1zS6IHqe5aw.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"真是的，一堆问题需要处理。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/I3uKEDS5RmhDcoyJPeheklu9nAjeXWRJ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"唉……真是受够了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/TcD4jXQfzik5fvPDlA9kSuDthcNFMtSf.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"已经过了不少时间了，能按时完成吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/6tx4Td8j9p3KDctcv0Mndc2m87nrNP6S.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"感觉都解决掉了……不过不到最后一刻都不能放松警惕。 我最讨厌麻烦事啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/8sIlNri1fYg3TlyJvHwCUD69yxcNf8IS.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"骚乱好像平息了。老师，辛苦了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/5yge3C0wyqdXqG2nIaSm3HlGuNuSsXlv.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventmission_1","category":"event","text":"虽然很麻烦……不过，幸好有老师陪着我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/w0Qcs6D9WPJhf7gZj3zccscOg1beDa2X.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventmission_2","category":"event","text":"好~~~~累啊……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/lyuYLW9WHA9T6bnVy41oJLL5qazyzYjX.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventmission_day_end","category":"event","text":"这样就收拾的差不多了。我得说一句，辛苦老师了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/bw0nKBLjRNYUpoIHcI8p1PLxwgAPPPjo.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventmission_get_1","category":"event","text":"呼……总算是解决了一件。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/1dqlRpHvf8JaEOyaRTpmweMdm8UrnZO2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventmission_get_2","category":"event","text":"解决了吗？辛苦您了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/8R2Dl36YuODvFIgeJuwNpwtoQP2fuQEw.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventmission_login_1","category":"event","text":"这些，都是必须解决的问题。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/in5p59vQHaF8PFUIKnBmknxaeYZpBFod.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_eventmission_login_2","category":"event","text":"老师，请确认清单。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/T7hE32aezp5p8fof4as93ZQBoHpXovlZ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"唉……那么，超级无敌铁甲虎丸号，出击。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/fEZbhXFgmH9pLcsoADMBvA2Poj4OE1dm.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"嗯……要不要出去巡逻呢，虎丸号？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/HD7aKZ3QGBgJb1SgCB4hsmAgA0d0KVNR.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"超级无敌铁甲虎丸号，前进……这名字好丢人啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/B4VwHLs3DFJ0yQHONgau9mKgY6gxljdM.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"好好，我这就出发。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/Q6OkQGsEtsKoDyfKvHCkhlBX8DODfByV.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"我知道了，真是的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/vpJPsEvQ3KJZGn2voH1eEYIaYstay8n7.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"那就没办法了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/FaMUvGjL02d9OIAqjzusLXHWcix8zRm1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"哎，真是的……既然您都做到这个地步了，我也只能拿出诚意了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/bx4sKzlAzuknS7tjs0FjrCgSOEVBC9JY.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"呃……好，我知道了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/yNKCNuUwU0LhM8uKLRQyYlhjUroFZ6vZ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"虽然已经预料到了……唉……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/GQZ9KNd7PxQKOLKv8Sc5DDwdZwZXVbgn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"唉，为什么会变成这样呢。算了，事到如今，该做的还是要做。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/S1H6SgV59ZbuzPnlsL9DeemGTV44R551.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"感觉……您好像不会随便让我偷懒……那就没办法了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/lvcmMXO9g92CosUjcfHpet42Td6ZCjYB.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"诶？您对我很感兴趣吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/yLPqD0iFBg6CPADDk3JBw2aobZ5ifMEV.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"诶，居然为我做到了这种地步吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/8tgmDNbW0EXiI7vM405Blav7kWoBtnVe.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"谢谢。干嘛，这种简单的道谢，我还是会说的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/fAlT0KydUpupojujNR2M2v2mOtBBXQ77.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"呼…… 我们要不要找个地方偷个懒？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/AllQcOhHCDKwh8VRGdO0TTfvHwpsj7Es.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"……您在认真工作吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/ZSio3KQTk2Bh7aq1g4Cxc0qtw6Qo3P1F.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"好麻烦……唉，没办法了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/eQpvD2vOozELLChZlWzOQgCYTsKdosAT.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"怎么了。该做的事情都做完了呀。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/DfC0SIT8WoJQnUBtcka8d8WVRFx46udi.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"您有什么事？是有委托吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/vfYEAOXyaSHHbiKpEflm0WRpRSHF1GXO.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"哈，什么嘛。竟然是值日…… 好好。既然已经接受了委托，我会尽心尽力的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/MqdPi2ceFiJxDAuC0lq7T9dbACsAcmyH.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊啊……老师，快过来。您看，有很多麻烦事需要处理哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/oFMu2TnyrpzLMRDGynJm6Mf3ssQltuDL.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿，这地方是不是很不错？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/nDlusrGlLXGhDHkf67M8ZRkubhnEeT7q.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"这软软的坐垫，摆得整整齐齐的零食。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/hiQiSIKsjl3wRKBsYRm75eo8cWQvaibV.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"再加上一堆书和游戏。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/ovdfY2HzLNdbJ9xWk9ra2e1ztWAjU9ZS.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"这就是我引以为傲的专属休息空间。老师觉得怎么样？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/tY1hS5QgH47I742bDeVtga0FtyPTpDt5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"哼哼，再多点感慨，多夸夸我也行哦？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/W9vR3s2XzBX5W3LIAlzNeIyUAKJ1mkID.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，既然现在有了同伙，那今天也和往常一样去偷个懒吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/2NHzO4OXqMsZZ6WYkqpdO89JOvGbRbZt.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"怎么样~？老师~？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/oQQZq072V3J7exfeprWH92zPix5FYOS2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"嘿嘿。嗯，看来波长还能对上嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/JDCUazQ423cUO3VMkpMeYzkkbpuAfXdf.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"我也不讨厌你依靠我了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/cUvaYmqIxUkTRN4FWkKpGeMsMv8KeGf9.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"但这么积极的方式，有点……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/BeAQSGOoX8t3GfHIKkBpROcmD0qMxmqf.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"心有灵犀……就是这样吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/5LvTLM8nsUqiXx49KyaMD9rM9KlZPLja.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"……啊？我的生日……？您怎么会知道…… 不是，倒也不是讨厌…… 请稍微离我远一点。现在先不要靠近我……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/Tm2GtAw2HjUY54oIqMD9vcTqajQTjSca.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"就算您不摆出那副表情，我也知道今天是老师的生日。 ……没办法，还是要祝贺一下。 老师，祝您生日快乐。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/BbVWkhptNnMFvhKmkGOag3qT4kKKY3QC.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"新春快乐，老师。祝您新年工作变少一点。别客气，这是同为中层管理者真挚的祝福。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/5rzzEFXyLRK39ocqjEOAJIndqlCvMQaI.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"好了，快把糖果交出来。 ……嗯？让我好好说？ 好好~不给糖就捣蛋~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/7pCNaOlYSq1UN3wDJiG3eXpnUwErwGNT.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"中秋节啊……老师，要不要摸个鱼，来我的秘密基地一起看看月亮？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9E%A3%20%E4%BC%8A%E5%90%95%E6%B3%A2/oQPddqpQFpwhZW5egMGaj53iDSMsJCBk.ogg"},{"description":"ch0156_season_newyear","ca